CHAPTER.VERS:
And the king of the Assyrians carried away the 

          Gr. Samaria to the Assyrians
         Samaritans to Assyria, and put them in Alae and in Abor, by the river Gozan, and in the mountains of the Medes;

for thus says the king of the Assyrians, 

          Lit. make a blessing with me
         Gain my favour, and come forth to me, and every man shall drink of the wine of his own vine, and every man shall eat of his own fig-tree, and shall drink water out of his own cistern;
